<doc id="163749" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=163749" title="Intel Core">
Intel Core

Intel Core mangkono minangka jinise &lt;a href="prosesor"&gt;prosesor&lt;/a&gt; kanggo pelanggan umum lan kantoran tingkat madya mandhuwur sing kapasarake dening &lt;a href="Intel"&gt;Intel&lt;/a&gt;. Jinis prosesor iki ngganteni prosesor &lt;a href="Pentium"&gt;Pentium&lt;/a&gt; tingkat madya mandhuwur sing wis ana rikala semana saengga mudhunake status Pentium dadi prosesor tingkat madya mangisor lan &lt;a href="Celeron"&gt;Celeron&lt;/a&gt; dadi prosesor sing paling asor. Prosesor Core sing meh padha utawa luwih canggih uga dipasarake kanthi aran &lt;a href="Xeon"&gt;Xeon&lt;/a&gt; kanggo komputer server lan kantoran. Nganti sasi Juni 2017, prosesor Core kaperang dadi &lt;a href="Intel%20Core%20i9"&gt;Intel Core i9&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Intel%20Core%20i7"&gt;Intel Core i7&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Intel%20Core%20i5"&gt;Intel Core i5&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Intel%20Core%20i3"&gt;Intel Core i3&lt;/a&gt; katambah Intel Core seri X.
